msgid ""
"Leaving a language field empty will skip that language entirely (no changes "
"will be made for it). Only one existing translation per language can be "
"entered at a time. If you have multiple translations to replace for the "
"same language, simply run the replacement again with the next value."
msgstr ""
"Če pustite polje za jezik prazno, se bo ta jezik v celoti preskočil (zanj "
